n per-program trace simulation, or vice versa), produced by a process with no access to the first derivation's intermediate work, plus a per-item agreement record comparing the two derivations.\",\n      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n        \"E-B: the re-derivation must use a method disjoint from the first derivation's method.\",\n        \"E-B: the re-derivation must be carried out without consulting the first derivation's intermediate work; an origin causally separated from the first derivation's author satisfies this, a same-process second pass does not.\",\n        \"E-B: per-item agreement between the two derivations must be explicitly recorded.\",\n        \"The re-deriving process may be given the package artifacts (spec, candidates, programs) but must not be given the first derivation's traces or working notes.\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"Q1\", \"Q2\", \"Q3\"],\n      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\"E-B\"],\n      \"features\": {\n        \"locally_resolvable\": false,\n        \"requires_isolation\": true,\n        \"contamination\": true,\n        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": true,\n        \"spans_sessions\": true\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
